{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《2026香港小姐競選決賽》今晚（8月30日）晚8時隆重舉行！12位候選佳麗袁絲珩Bernice、李澤欣Scarlett、李澄晴Chorie、譚雅文Tiffany、魏欣Etherine、盧蔚晴Jasmine、楊媛媛Vera 、鄧匡閔Ada、周芳姿Gracia、陳梓穎Cecilia、顏懿菲Agnes、湯家琳Caris將競逐本年度香港小姐冠、亞、季軍、最上鏡小姐及總值超逾港幣651萬獎金及獎品。</span><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4b8ce105-226b-4027-b67f-f2073adfbbbc.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026LhAbKXO4Gp1788088342.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4b8ce105-226b-4027-b67f-f2073adfbbbc.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">大會除了特別邀請到馬國明、蕭正楠、曹永廉、陸浩明及鄭衍峰共5位組成星級司儀陣容，更邀得陳美齡、苟芸慧、伍允龍及謝天華擔任「最上鏡小姐」評判，見證新一屆港姐的誕生。決賽前18:30時半舉紅地氈，無綫集團有限公司行政主席許濤JP、總經理（商務運營）蕭世和先生等一眾高層以及大批TVB藝人們盛裝打扮陸續登場，現場星光熠熠！</span><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"341bb424-e416-4b50-91d8-77672a4d9627.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026J6qn0GulNw1788088341.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"341bb424-e416-4b50-91d8-77672a4d9627.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b20657f0-da26-49d4-808b-cac824e38948.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026bnLyGXdoVJ1788088341.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b20657f0-da26-49d4-808b-cac824e38948.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c1da49ef-5811-42ff-96dc-147cf330dbba.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026zebriH5QFu1788088343.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c1da49ef-5811-42ff-96dc-147cf330dbba.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0p